   "group": "g11",
   "start": 77.674,
   "end": 88.326,
   "text": "Ethics. Medical crowdfunding me paisa sirf need se nahi, network aur deserving dikhne se bhi milta hai, aur campaign ausatan target ka lagbhag chalis percent hi jutata hai. Swipe-able bana do to gareebi ka For You page ready.",
   "cap": "Ethics. Medical crowdfunding me paisa sirf need se nahi, network aur deserving dikhne se bhi milta hai, aur campaign ausatan target ka lagbhag chalis percent hi jutata hai. Swipe-able bana do to gareebi ka For You page ready."
